column3:
	「
38d820	core	A hairy drunkard has come hither to once more disrespect the sanctity of life, I see.	またしても命の尊厳を踏みにじりに来たか、毛むくじゃらの酔っぱらいめ{REST}
38d820	core	Ah, but my goods are not free!	ああ、だが俺の品物はただじゃないぞ！{REST}
38d820	core	Ah, wonderful.	ああ、いいね{REST}
38d820	core	All I see here is not enough.	ここにあるものじゃ、まだ全然足りないな{REST}
38d820	core	Are these gifts?	これは贈り物なのか？{REST}
38d820	core	At no price?	ただで？{REST}
38d820	core	Do not tempt me!	誘惑するな！{REST}
38d820	core	Do reflect.	よく考えてみろ{REST}
38d820	core	Do you wish to trade or to make an offering to our leader?	取引がしたいのか、それともうちの長に捧げ物をしたいのか？{REST}
38d820	core	Do you wish to trade?	取引がしたいのか？{REST}
38d820	core	Even with your combined trade goods, such as they are, I can't fathom you ending up with the items you desire.	お前たちの取引品をすべて合わせても、お前らが欲しいものが手に入るとは到底思えないな{REST}
38d820	core	For me?	俺にか？{REST}
38d820	core	Greetings from our mountain halls to yours.	{REST}我らの山の館からの挨拶だ
38d820	core	I am a merchant, yes.	ああ、俺は商人だ{REST}
38d820	core	I am beside myself with grief.	悲しみで気が狂いそうだ{REST}
38d820	core	I can accept your offer, or perhaps you wish to trade.	お前の申し出を受けてもいいが、取引がしたいのかもな{REST}
38d820	core	I can't stop you.	お前を止めることなんてできないよ{REST}
38d820	core	I cannot take so much -- and at such cost!	こんなに多くは受け取れん。この値段でなど！{REST}
38d820	core	I must make a profit.	利益を出さなきゃならないんだ{REST}
38d820	core	I see your low race still revels in death.	お前ら下等な種族は、まだ死を楽しんでるようだな{REST}
38d820	core	I will see that our leader gets this offering.	この捧げ物は、うちの長に必ず届けておくよ{REST}
38d820	core	I wish I could take so much, but my animals...	こんなに受け取れたらいいんだが、うちの動物たちが…{REST}
38d820	core	I won't trade at a loss.	損をする取引はしないぞ{REST}
38d820	core	It is a rude bauble, fit only for your kind.	お前らみたいな連中にしか似合わない、下品な飾り物だな{REST}
38d820	core	Leave it to the besotted dullard to miss the finer points of discourse.	酔いどれの間抜けには、話の細かい妙味なんて分かりっこないな{REST}
38d820	core	Let us strengthen our bonds in trade.	{REST}取引で絆を深めようじゃないか
38d820	core	Let us trade!	取引させろ！{REST}
38d820	core	Let's make a deal!	{REST}取引しようぜ！
38d820	core	My beasts of burden cannot possibly haul such a load.	うちの荷駄獣じゃ、こんな荷は到底運べないぜ{REST}
38d820	core	My stones, are you giving me those?	{REST}俺の石を、お前はくれるつもりか？
38d820	core	Now, what do offer for them?	さて、それに対して何を出す？{REST}
38d820	core	Obviously, your copious wit is matched only by your industry!	お前のありあまる機知は、その勤勉さに負けず劣らずだな！{REST}
38d820	core	Once a beautiful tree, and now?	かつては美しい木だったのに、今は？{REST}
38d820	core	Perhaps next time I visit you'll take this seriously.	次に来たときは、もっとまじめに取り組んでくれよ{REST}
38d820	core	Perhaps we will show you how they suffered.	やつらがどう苦しんだか、お前にも見せてやろうか{REST}
38d820	core	Perhaps you'd consider tossing in a little extra?	もう少しおまけを付けてくれないか？{REST}
38d820	core	Please understand the journey must be profitable.	旅は利益が出なきゃならないってことを分かってくれ{REST}
38d820	core	Simply tell me what interests you and what you're prepared to offer in exchange.	何に興味があって、代わりに何を出せるのか、言ってくれればいい{REST}
38d820	core	Take what you wish.	好きなだけ持っていけ{REST}
38d820	core	Thank you for your business.	取引ありがとう{REST}
38d820	core	That poor, gentle creature...	あの哀れで心優しい生き物は…{REST}
38d820	core	The {1}ship of the {2} is unparalleled.	{REST}{2}の{1}船は比類がない
38d820	core	There is simply not enough value here.	ここには価値が全然足りないな{REST}
38d820	core	These _are_ fine items, aren't they?	これは_本当に_良い品だろう？{REST}
38d820	core	These goods are too heavy and cheap for me to consider.	この品は重すぎるし安すぎて、取引対象にならんな{REST}
38d820	core	This would please us greatly.	それはとても喜ばしいことだ{REST}
38d820	core	We are enchanted by your more ethical works.	お前たちのより倫理的な仕事に、すっかり魅了されてるんだ{REST}
38d820	core	We love gifts.	贈り物は大好きだぜ{REST}
38d820	core	We've come to trade.	取引しに来たんだ{REST}
38d820	core	What do you offer in trade?	取引として何を差し出すんだ？{REST}
38d820	core	What do you offer?	何を差し出すんだ？{REST}
38d820	core	What do you want?	何の用だ？{REST}
38d820	core	Which of my goods do you desire?	俺の品物のどれが欲しいんだ？{REST}
38d820	core	Yes, and trade we will!	{REST}ああ、取引しようじゃないか！
38d820	core	You are too kind.	ずいぶん親切だな{REST}
38d820	core	You see, I wish to trade.	見ての通り、取引がしたいんだよ{REST}
38d820	core	You truly despise life, don't you?	お前は本当に命を軽んじてるんだな？{REST}
38d820	core	You wish to make an offering to our leader?	うちの長に捧げ物をしたいってのか？{REST}
38d820	core	You wish to make an offering?	捧げ物をしたいのか？{REST}
38d820	core	You'll need more goods to make this arrangement.	この取引を成立させるには、もっと品物が必要だぞ{REST}
38d820	core	Your childish games have made me tired.	お前の子供じみた遊びには、もううんざりだ{REST}
38d820	core	[Chuckles]  How droll.	[Chuckles]  なんとも面白いな{REST}
38d820	core	[Laughs uproariously]  You had me going there.	[Laughs uproariously]  やられたよ、一瞬本気にしちまった{REST}
38d820	core	{1}Your efforts are legend there.	{1}お前の功績はあそこで伝説になってるぞ{REST}
38d820	core	{1}ship of the {2} is unparalleled.	{1}の{2}の出来栄えは比類ないな{REST}
38d820	suffix	{1}{2}

{1}{2}	「{1}{2}
8084c0.1	prefix		
8084c0.1	core	You've found {1}!
